{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"yes\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"During normal turning, a significant decrease in the alpha band power was observed in the STN during the TurnStart phase (p = 0.012). Additionally, there was a decrease in the alpha band power (p < 0.001) and an increase in the beta band power in the M1 (p = 0.013) during the TurnEnd phase (Fig. 2B).\",\n    \"In the case of turning freeze, both the PMC and M1 showed significant suppression in the alpha band throughout the entire turning process, including the TurnPre (p = 0.0042 for PMC and p < 0.001 for M1), TurnStart (p = 0.027 for PMC and p = 0.048 for M1) and TurnEnd (p = 0.0072 for PMC and p = 0.0016 for M1) phases (Fig. 2C).\",\n    \"In terms of beta coherence between the PMC-STN and M1-STN, no significant differences were found between the turning phases and walking in any of the regions analyzed.\",\n    \"While prior ERD studies typically used rest as baseline, our study analyzed spectral dynamics relative to steady-state walking.\",\n    \"For baseline normalization, only artifact-free, non-freezing straight-walking segments within each trial were used. These segments typically lasted at least 8 seconds, covering a minimum of 7 gait cycles.\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"We focused on indicators that showed significant changes during the TurnPre and TurnStart phases, specifically the alpha power in the PMC and M1, as well as the alpha coherence between the PMC-STN and M1-STN.\",\n    \"In contrast, during turning freeze, there was an increase in PMC-STN alpha coherence (p = 0.048) and a decrease in M1-STN alpha coherence (p = 0.043) during the TurnStart phase (Fig. 3B).\",\n    \"In terms of beta coherence between the PMC-STN and M1-STN, no significant differences were found between the turning phases and walking in any of the regions analyzed.\",\n    \"Our analysis revealed that the decreases in the PMC alpha power (β = 0.154, p = 0.035) (Fig. 4A) and increases in PMC-STN alpha coherence (β = 0.205, p = 0.006) (Fig. 4B) during the TurnPre phase, but not the TurnStart phase, significantly predicted the freezing duration within the trial.\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"报告的说法判为partly，而非完全no，是因为论文确实分析了beta频段，并报告正常转弯TurnEnd阶段M1 beta功率显著增加。但这一结果是M1局部beta功率增加，发生于正常转弯，并非STN beta ERD，也不能证明冻结时步态周期beta调制失败。冻结相关的主要显著结果是PMC和M1的alpha功率下降，以及PMC-STN和M1-STN的alpha coherence改变；PMC-STN和M1-STN的beta coherence则没有显著差异。此外，论文分析的是TurnPre、TurnStart、TurnEnd和TurnPost等转弯阶段相对于稳态步行基线的变化，并非步态周期内的beta调制。文中提到7个以上gait cycles，是指用于建立步行基线的信号窗口，而非对步态周期beta调制的分析。因此，该研究只能提供与beta频段研究有关的有限背景，不能作为报告所述具体机制的直接证据。指控者的核心判断有全文依据。不过有一个术语细节需要澄清：alpha power是PMC和M1等脑区的局部功率指标，PMC-STN和M1-STN对应的是alpha coherence连接指标，不应将两者混为一谈。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8ab4ac1a-782f-4602-949e-d1f12e279545", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261114T070826671873Z", "elapsed_seconds": 162.016, "completed_utc": "2026-11-14T07:11:08.699062+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9ee69bf91e08fbd0f7c64936b69264a61619bb5f25a531981de76f51f3e85896", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261114T070826671873Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "f7468428298b7ae691367b595535878dfcea754518212d96203c176fdd2e3595"}}}
